# Marketing content sync

Source: `/Users/zukman/GIT/{AppName}/` — `marketing/` or `Marketing/`, `docs/`, screenshots, `AppConfig`.

Canonical slug map: `lib/productApps.ts` (do not duplicate here).

## Workflow

1. English first: `messages/apps/{slug}/en.json`
2. Assets: `public/images/{slug}/`, icon `{slug}-icon.png`
3. Page order: mirror `hush-gallery` / `whistle-camera`
4. AEO lockstep: `public/{slug}/faq.md` + `public/llms.txt` (+ `ai.txt` if new app)
5. Home match: `messages/shared/en.json` → `home.{namespace}`

```bash
python3 scripts/sync-product-marketing.py --app all
npm run build
```

## Copy

- Lead with user benefit; package IDs only as facts
- FAQ: 8–12 real Q&As; first sentence of each answer is citation-ready
- No placeholder screenshots; no invented store IDs

Skill: `.cursor/skills/product-page-enrichment/SKILL.md`
